# Environment variables for Australian Electric Motor Co
# Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the real values in
# Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables (all environments).
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are exposed to the browser bundle — that's correct
# for these two (both are public-by-design keys used in client-side form POSTs).

# Web3Forms access key — powers the /contact/ and /wholesale/ forms.
# Create a key at https://web3forms.com and set the destination inbox there
# (e.g. orders@australianelectricmotorco.com.au once Zoho Mail is live).
# Without it, the forms fall back to the thank-you page and deliver nowhere.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=""

# Optional — Cloudflare Turnstile site key for form spam protection.
# Not yet wired into the form components; set this when you add it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=""

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# Create a GA4 property at https://analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams
# → Web, then copy the Measurement ID. Set it here for local dev and in
# Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables (all environments) for production,
# then redeploy. Empty = no analytics tag is rendered at all.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=""
